The only way to reach Skuldafn is by forcing [[Skyrim:Odahviing|Odahviing]] to fly you there; this is accomplished during the quest [[Skyrim:The Fallen|The Fallen]]. He will fly away after leaving you there. The only way to leave Skuldafn is to take the portal to the [[Skyrim:Sovngarde (place)|Nordic afterlife]].

